### Admin: get session details before timing update
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: update scheduledDate + duration (minutes) on a scheduled session
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sessions/{{sessionId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledDate": "2026-12-05T10:00:00.000Z",
  "scheduledDurationMinutes": 60,
  "reason": "Adjusted session date and 60-minute duration"
}

### Admin: update start time, end time, and duration
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sessions/{{sessionId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledDurationMinutes": 45,
  "startedAt": "2026-12-05T10:05:00.000Z",
  "endedAt": "2026-12-05T10:50:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Corrected actual start and end timestamps"
}

### Admin: validation error test — endedAt earlier than startedAt (expect 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sessions/{{sessionId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-12-05T11:00:00.000Z",
  "endedAt": "2026-12-05T10:30:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Invalid end before start check"
}